  {
    id: "cart_ruts",
    title: "The Frozen Ruts",
    kind: Wild,
    text: "The ruts froze deep and then froze again, and walking them is walking a badly built staircase that goes on for a mile. Something has been dragged along here recently: a long smooth channel between the ridges, and no footprints beside it.",
    a: { label: "Keep north for the ford", goto: "north_ford", energy: 12, coin: 0, note: "" },
    b: {
      label: "The ruts bend west -- follow them",
