  {
    id: "ferry_landing",
    title: "The Ferry Landing",
    kind: Empty,
    text: "A plank jetty, a chain, and a ferryman who is already here. He is always already here. His fare is three coin and he does not haggle, and he takes the coin without once looking at it, as a man does with a thing he has counted many times before.",
    a: { label: "Pay the fare and cross", goto: "far_bank", energy: 5, coin: 3, note: "" },
