  {
    id: "sunken_road",
    title: "The Sunken Road",
    kind: Empty,
    text: "The road here runs below the level of the fields, walled either side by root and clay, so that you see nothing of the country but a strip of sky. It has been going down for a long time. You have not once felt yourself descend.",
    a: { label: "Keep on until it surfaces", goto: "mire", energy: 13, coin: 0, note: "" },
    b: {
      label: "Climb out and take your bearings",
