    text: "A long low building that sells bread, beds and shoe-nails, and buys labour by the watch. The keeper has a ledger going back further than the building, and when you ask her about the stones east of here she turns the page before she answers, which is not the same as not answering.",
    a: { label: "Take the river track west", goto: "far_bank", energy: 10, coin: 0, note: "" },
