    text: "The notch is a gate cut through the ridge itself, and across it stands a door of black wood with no handle, no hinge and no keyhole. Three lines are cut into it, deep and clean. Above the lintel, on a stone perch worn to a hollow, sits a crow that has been waiting the entire length of this road.",
    a: { label: "Speak to the door", goto: "hollow_end", energy: 2, coin: 0, note: "" },
    b: { label: "Turn back onto the heath", goto: "heath", energy: 8, coin: 0, note: "" },
